///1RMAC
Help by Willem Aandewiel
RMAC - Digital Research relocatable macro assembler

///2SYNTAX
  E>A:RMAC DEMO

Reads DEMO.ASM; creates DEMO.REL, DEMO.PRN and DEMO.SYM.

///2EXAMPLE
  E>A:RMAC DEMO
  E>A:LINK DEMO

Check assembly and linker messages before running DEMO.COM.

///2MODULES
PUBLIC exposes symbols to other modules.
EXTRN refers to symbols defined elsewhere.
CSEG and DSEG distinguish code and data segments.
LOAD is not intended for RMAC output; use LINK.
